@startwbs
' SmartExam Work Breakdown Structure (top levels), per Chapter-3-3 (fig:wbs).
' The development branch groups modules M1-M12 by sprint (Chapter-1-8, tab:timeframe);
' in the sprint backlog it is split further into the individual modules.
' Render: java -jar plantuml.jar -tpng work_breakdown_structure.puml
skinparam dpi 150
<style>
wbsDiagram {
  FontName Arial
  FontSize 13
  BackgroundColor white
  LineColor #555555
  node {
    BackgroundColor white
    LineColor #555555
    RoundCorner 4
    Padding 6
  }
  :depth(0) {
    BackgroundColor #B03A2E
    FontColor white
    FontStyle bold
    FontSize 14
    LineColor #B03A2E
  }
  :depth(1) {
    BackgroundColor #D9D9D9
    FontStyle bold
    FontSize 13
  }
  :depth(2) {
    BackgroundColor #F5F5F5
  }
}
</style>
* SmartExam\nAI-Driven Lab Exam Monitoring and Management System
** 1 Planning and\nRequirements\n(Sprint 1)
*** 1.1 Requirements\nand use cases
*** 1.2 Product backlog
*** 1.3 Architecture
*** 1.4 Scope approval
** 2 Module Development\n(Sprints 2-7)
*** <b>2.1 Access and identity</b> (Sprint 2)\nM1 Authentication, device binding\nM7 User and role management
*** <b>2.2 Exam set-up</b> (Sprint 3)\nM8 Exam creation, configuration\nM9 Eligibility, access control
*** <b>2.3 Student exam client</b> (Sprint 4)\nM2 Readiness check, practice\nM3 Student exam dashboard\nM4 Secure exam environment
*** <b>2.4 Monitoring and proctoring</b> (Sprint 5)\nM5 Live monitoring client\nM10 Live proctoring dashboard
*** <b>2.5 Submission and evaluation</b> (Sprint 6)\nM6 Submission and backup\nM11 AI-assisted evaluation
*** <b>2.6 Logs and reporting</b> (Sprint 7)\nM12 Logs, analytics, audit trail
** 3 Integration\nand Testing\n(Sprint 8)
*** 3.1 Module tests\n(xUnit, Playwright)
*** 3.2 Integration\nof M1-M12
*** 3.3 End-to-end\nsystem testing
*** 3.4 Bug fixing
** 4 Documentation\nand Delivery\n(all sprints)
*** 4.1 Sprint reviews
*** 4.2 FYP-1 report
*** 4.3 Final thesis
*** 4.4 Final demo
@endwbs
